psf_utils (GPL-3.0-or-later), repository KenKundert/psf_utils on GitHub, commit
67971463a7bfdbfdb362376374b68fef379c6f9e (v1.11): the native psfascii files of its samples/ directory
that §11 names.  joop-banaan.{dc,tran} are two Spectre 19.1.0.373.isr7 runs of a point netlist (their
design line is the comment "// Point Netlist Generated on: ..."; both carry "rabsshort", §8.3).
pnoise.raw is one complete Spectre 15.1.0.284.isr1 results directory (a noise and a pnoise analysis
of two nodes, a pss, a linear and a logarithmic ac) with its logFile, the only logFile sample besides
the 23.1 one; the pnoise and pss files are analysis kinds vamos does not write, kept because the
logFile names them.  The other samples/ files are not copied: dan-zilla.psfascii, fracpole.ac and
rushikesh-dhanaji-phadtare.tran are Cadence-converted GROUP layouts, fracpole.spac and fracpole.spdc
SINGLE layouts, header.psf a header only, bus_chevrons.tran and escaped-strings.dc hand-edited
fixtures (design §13 E86), and the rest further analysis kinds (stb, pz, dcop, info) or a netlist.

